{"version":1,"content":"<p>Mozilla 於周二發佈 Firefox 161，為瀏覽器帶來更精細的 VPN 管理能力。用户現在可以在 Firefox 的 VPN 面板中使用「管理 VPN 規則」選項，為特定網站設置 VPN 自動開啓或自動關閉，從而無需在每次訪問相關頁面時手動切換 VPN 狀態。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587870.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T19:44:25.380027+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T19:23:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T19:37:36.758208+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T19:37:36.758208+00:00","content_hash":"f78926110d7febeabf47cd88b936956630b0834cc16ceb14b5b0d529bfb09892","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}